            "review_title": "Review at NakaThai Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "jrcoco\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nAuthetic Thai Food - delicious!\nAug 2019\nWe were a party of four and all of us just loved the food! Not only do you really get the thai flavor we were craving but you also get it for a very very reasonable price! The entrance to the restaurant is a bit surprising - a small green Beer Alley with high tables where you can enjoy a drink and a smoke, then you walk up to the dining room. Cheerful, yet cozy interieur with very comfortable seating. Our waiter, Jay, was very friendly and accommodating and helped us with our selection.\nFood was served fast and hot, and did I mention - it was delicious! \nIt is not a crowded, loud place, so really great for a relaxing dinner or lunch with friends. We didn't have kids, but I can understand why families would go there - they offer a little play area for the kids.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
