            "review_title": "Review at NakaThai Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "ChrisSurb\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam309 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Thai in the heart of Thao Dien\nJul 2018 • Couples\nHaving travelled the Thailand frequently in recent years I can say that the food is just as good if not better than anything I've had in Thailand. It;s located half way down \"restaurant street\" on Tran Ngoc Dien. The restaurant is very comfortable with cool tables and chairs and an excellent bar and I like the funky contemporary Thai design .... Friendly professional service and they also do a very good home delivery service .....Particular favourites for me are the Mamassam Curry, the papaya salad and the crab cakes ......\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 30, 2018",
